      "value": "It seems three of these languages have been added to VRChat thanks to this separate post on another thread.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-these-16-languages-to-the-website-language-selection\n\nUnfortunately, only Filipino, Bahasa Melayu, and Bahasa Indonesia were added. Which leaves Lao, Khmer, and Burmese absent in the game.",
