  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There is a substantial amount of users that use these languages and it should be an option to display these languages in their profiles.\n\nThe language for the Philippines ought to be, **[PHI] Filipino**, this is to adhere to the efforts to be inclusive of all Philippine languages rather than making it *Tagalog* or *Bisaya*.\n\nThe addition of two distinct Malay languages should also be considered, both the **[MLY] Bahasa Melayu** and the **[INS] Bahasa Indonesia**.\n\nThe languages of **[THA] Thai** and **[VIE] Vietnamese** are also available in VRChat, so the addition of **[LAO] Lao**, **[KHM] Khmer**, and **[BRM] Burmese** should also be made available.\n\n*More importantly, these should be added as to take advantage of the new profile layout that allows users to see the languages that a user speaks.*\n\n# TL;DR\n\nAdd more Southeast asian languages.\n\n- [PHI] Filipino\n\n- [MLY] Bahasa Melayu\n\n- [INS] Bahasa Indonesia\n\n- [LAO] Lao\n\n- [KHM] Khmer\n\n- [BRM] Burmese",
